TASK B01
	TITLE "Repository skeleton and entry point"
	STATUS todo
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.M0
	COMPONENT "cli"
	ROLE bastien
	SPEC "brigade --version prints the version; brigade --version --json prints a JSON document"
		+ "carrying schema_version and version"
	SPEC "python3 -m unittest passes and holds black-box tests under tests/cli that run brigade as"
		+ "a subprocess, through the entry point of the clone and through dist/brigade.pyz"
	SPEC "from a clone, a symlink into a directory on PATH runs brigade from any working directory;"
		+ "the README states that install and no longer describes a repository without code"
	SPEC "one documented command needing python3 alone builds dist/brigade.pyz with the zipapp"
		+ "module, and python3 dist/brigade.pyz --version prints the version"
	SPEC "the Python floor, 3.11, is declared in one place; under it, brigade exits non-zero with a"
		+ "message naming 3.11 and the running version"
	SPEC "a GitHub Actions workflow runs the unit tests and the zipapp build on Python 3.11 and on"
		+ "the latest Python release, on every pull request"
	SPEC "the Commands section of AGENTS.md lists the commands that run the tests, build the zipapp"
		+ "and install brigade"
	RATIONALE "every other task of M0 adds a command to the entry point this task delivers, and the"
		+ "tests/cli harness it starts is the acceptance suite"
		+ "@DECISION.ThePortableContractIsTheCommandLineAndNeutralFiles sets"
		REF @DECISION.ThePortableContractIsTheCommandLineAndNeutralFiles
	RATIONALE "the standard library and the 3.11 floor follow @DECISION.PythonStandardLibraryOnly;"
		+ "the zipapp and the clone are the two installs of"
		+ "@DECISION.BrigadeInstallsFromOneFileWithFourPrerequisites, so the build needs python3"
		+ "alone and no make"
		REF @DECISION.PythonStandardLibraryOnly
		REF @DECISION.BrigadeInstallsFromOneFileWithFourPrerequisites
	RATIONALE "the reference machine runs Python 3.13.5: only the CI proves the floor on a real"
		+ "3.11"
	SOURCE "the Artifact Brigade Blueprint, plan sections 15 and 16; the user's rulings of"
		+ "2026-10-05 in the refinement of B01"

TASK B02
	TITLE "brigade doctor: the prerequisites checked, the optional items reported with their"
		+ "fallback"
	STATUS todo
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.M0
	COMPONENT "cli"
	ROLE bastien
	SPEC "brigade doctor checks Python 3.11 or later, git and awawa 2.7 or later, each line naming"
		+ "the version found and its floor"
	SPEC "it reports as optional, each with its fallback: a user systemd instance, else a cron line"
		+ "or brigade tick --loop; gh and the login it is active as, else local mode without a"
		+ "forge; awawa-web, else the dashboard's corpus view only"
	SPEC "it prints text and --json; the JSON document carries schema_version and one entry per"
		+ "item with its name, its state (ok, warning or finding), its detail and its fallback"
	SPEC "it exits 0, or 1 with findings; a missing optional item is a warning, never a finding"
	SPEC "tests under tests/cli prove each finding and each warning by running brigade doctor with"
		+ "a PATH of fixture executables"
	AFTER @TASK.B01
	RATIONALE "doctor tells on a new machine whether brigade can run there: Python 3.11 or later,"
		+ "git, awawa and one adapted client are the prerequisites, every other item optional with"
		+ "a fallback, as @DECISION.BrigadeInstallsFromOneFileWithFourPrerequisites sets"
		REF @DECISION.BrigadeInstallsFromOneFileWithFourPrerequisites
	RATIONALE "B02 reads no config.toml: each binding's line comes with the task that first uses"
		+ "it, the client probe with @TASK.B42, the instructions corpus with @TASK.B43, the check"
		+ "of the configured forge account with @TASK.B46; the IDE plugin is not reported, no shell"
		+ "command probes it"
		REF @TASK.B42
		REF @TASK.B43
		REF @TASK.B46
	RATIONALE "the Python line can only report the running version: under 3.11 the entry point of"
		+ "@TASK.B01 exits before doctor runs"
		REF @TASK.B01
	RATIONALE "--json and the black-box tests follow"
		+ "@DECISION.ThePortableContractIsTheCommandLineAndNeutralFiles"
		REF @DECISION.ThePortableContractIsTheCommandLineAndNeutralFiles
	SOURCE "the Artifact Brigade Blueprint, plan section 16, row setup, and the brigade doctor"
		+ "mockup; the user's rulings of 2026-10-05 in the refinement of B02"

