TASK B42
	TITLE "Client adapter contract, the Claude Code adapter and the fake adapter"
	STATUS draft
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.M0
	COMPONENT "adapters"
	ROLE bastien
	SPEC "the contract is five operations answered as JSON documents, probe, launch, result, resume"
		+ "and transcripts; brigade adapter probe|launch-argv|parse-result expose them on the"
		+ "command line"
	SPEC "the Claude Code adapter maps capabilities to tool grants, the reasoning level to a model"
		+ "and an effort, passes the role package as an appended system prompt, caps the turns at"
		+ "the budget plus a quarter, and normalises the result object into outcome, steps, usage,"
		+ "session id, duration and error class, a rate limit classified and its reset hour parsed"
		+ "when named"
	SPEC "an adapter is a built-in module or an executable brigade-client-<name> on PATH;"
		+ "config.toml selects it and PROJECT.CLIENT overrides it"
	SPEC "the fake adapter replays recorded result documents and is the one the test suite launches"
