TASK B47
	TITLE "Collector contract, runner and the built-in collectors"
	STATUS draft
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.M1
	COMPONENT "studies"
	ROLE bastien
	SPEC "a collector is an executable or a built-in that reads BRIGADE_PROJECT_PATH,"
		+ "BRIGADE_SINCE, BRIGADE_RUN_DIR and BRIGADE_PARAMS from its environment and prints one"
		+ "JSON document with schema, collector, collected_at, summary and items"
	SPEC "brigade collect <name> [key=value...] runs one collector, writes its document and a"
		+ "sidecar with command, duration, exit code and hash under the run directory, and prints"
		+ "the summary; a cache keyed by the hash of command and inputs answers a repeated call,"
		+ "--refresh bypasses it"
	SPEC "collectors resolve in order: the project's .brigade/collectors/, the machine's collectors"
		+ "directory, brigade-collector-<name> on PATH, the built-ins; brigade collectors list"
		+ "prints them with their source"
	SPEC "the built-ins: git-log, git-diff-stat, worktrees, corpus (awawa --json at a ref through"
		+ "the corpus reader), ledger (an event slice with aggregates), pr-list, pr-threads and"
		+ "check-runs (through the forge adapter), transcripts (through the client adapter,"
		+ "scrubbed), shell (a command line declared in the study), study (another study's last"
		+ "answer)"
	SPEC "a collector never launches a model; the test suite proves it by running every built-in"
		+ "with the fake adapter and no client on PATH"
	AFTER @TASK.B05
	AFTER @TASK.B08
	AFTER @TASK.B42

TASK B48
	TITLE "STUDY entity, brigade study commands, study.md, scheduling by the tick"
	STATUS draft
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.M1
	COMPONENT "studies"
	ROLE bastien
	SPEC "study new records a STUDY entity through fmt, lint and a commit, with the question"
		+ "verbatim, the project when there is one, the collectors, the slot or none, the schedule"
		+ "or none, the output and the template, and runs it once unless --every is given"
	SPEC "study run runs the ordered steps collect, judge and output: the collectors, then the"
		+ "slot's role through brigade run with the procedure study.md, then the output; a study"
		+ "with SLOT none writes the collected output to its destination and launches nothing"
	SPEC "each step's result is a file under runs/<id>/steps/, and a resumed study restarts at its"
		+ "first undone step; this layout and the event names below are the recipe engine's"
		+ "contract, which replaces this orchestration in M8 without a command changing"
	SPEC "study context prints the question, each collector's summary with the path of its full"
		+ "document, the template's skeleton filled with the collected values and the expected"
		+ "shape of the answer; the full package is written to the run directory"
	SPEC "study answer --file validates the answer against the template's sections or the output's"
		+ "schema, refuses an answer that changed a CLI-filled section, writes it to the output,"
		+ "file on a branch of the project with a pull request where the project has a forge,"
		+ "corpus entity through fmt, lint and a commit, inbox signal, forge issue or"
		+ "brigade-output-<name> on PATH"
	SPEC "the tick runs each due study under the slot cap and records order.started, step.done,"
		+ "step.failed, order.parked and order.done with kind study"
	SPEC "study list, show, pause and resume; list prints every study with its schedule, last run"
		+ "and last outcome, text and --json"
	AFTER @TASK.B06
	AFTER @TASK.B07
	AFTER @TASK.B43
	AFTER @TASK.B47

